  "description": "An ancient \"princely\" grave was discovered in the 19th century at the village of Vall\u00f8by in Denmark. Among the grave goods were some Roman imports. It is not known if the tomb, which was reportedly marked by a circular stone structure, was singular or part of a larger cemetery.",
